# 🎬 Movie Recommendation System

A content-based movie recommendation system built using Python, Pandas, Scikit-learn, NLP, and Streamlit.

## Features
- Recommends similar movies
- Uses cosine similarity
- Content-based filtering
- Interactive Streamlit interface

## Tech Stack
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Scikit-learn
- NLTK
- Streamlit

## Dataset
TMDB 5000 Movies Dataset

## Installation

git clone https://github.com/shreyas-kocheri/Movie-Recommendation-System.git

cd Movie-Recommendation-System

pip install -r requirements.txt

streamlit run app.py

## Project Structure

app.py
recommendationsystem.ipynb
requirements.txt
tmdb_5000_movies.csv
tmdb_5000_credits.csv

